[Line "Against 3...d6"]
[Opening "Italian Game: Paris Defense"]

{Another slow reply. Open the centre while Black is passive.} 1. e4 {Take the centre and open lines for the queen and the f1 bishop.} 1... e5 2. Nf3 {Develop with an attack on e5.} 2... Nc6 3. Bc4 {The Italian: the bishop aims at f7, the weakest square in Black's camp.} 3... d6 4. d4 {Strike while Black is playing slowly.} 4... exd4 5. Nxd4 {Recapture, with a strong knight in the centre.} *
